 Class


Represents the PDF text annotation.

This  class is used to add the text directly on the page. Please refer the UG docuemntation link  for more details.


//Create a new PDF document.
PdfDocument document = new PdfDocument();
//Create a new page.
PdfPage page = document.Pages.Add();
//Create a new rectangle
RectangleF textAnnotationBounds = new RectangleF(10, 40, 100, 30);
//Create a new line annotation.
